  << /ActualText (SwissCave is a Swiss\055designed brand of wine cabinets and climate\055control systems built for serious collectors\056 Their units combine precise temperature regulation\054 low\055vibration compressors\054 UV\055protected glazing\054 and refined cabinetry \024 engineered to preserve wine in optimal conditions over decades\054 not seasons\056 Cellar Studio specifies SwissCave across our curated wine cabinet collection and integrates their systems into bespoke cellar installations where climate accuracy and acoustic discretion are non\055negotiable\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 2195 0 R
     /Pg 1520 0 R
