2196 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Raching is a specialist manufacturer of premium humidor and cigar\055storage technology\054 recognised for advanced humidity regulation\054 Spanish cedar interiors\054 and precision electronic control\056 Their systems are engineered specifically for the long\055term preservation of premium cigars\054 holding stable humidity within tight tolerances regardless of ambient conditions\056 Cellar Studio integrates Raching technology into our Sorella and Heritage humidor lines\054 and into bespoke cigar room and lounge projects where consistent humidity is critical to the collection\047s value\056)
